.com/n/%E6%96%B0%E6%99%BA%E5%85%83"&gt;@新智元&lt;/a&gt; 硅谷Clawdbot爆火，开源免费的7x24h AI员工星标破2万&lt;a href="https://weibo.com/5703921756/5259296809158311" data-hide=""&gt;&lt;span class="url-icon"&gt;&lt;img style="width: 1rem;height: 1rem" src="https://h5.sinaimg.cn/upload/2015/09/25/3/timeline_card_small_web_default.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="surl-text"&gt;网页链接&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://weibo.com/n/%E9%BB%98%E5%BA%B5%C2%B7%E8%B6%85%E7%BA%A7%E4%B8%AA%E4%BD%93"&gt;@默庵·超级个体&lt;/a&gt; 5美元就能拥有的Clawdbot是聊天APP里的全能AI助手&lt;a href="https://weibo.com/5078115336/5258988154782797" data-hide=""&gt;&lt;span class="url-icon"&gt;&lt;img style="width: 1rem;height: 1rem" src="https://h5.sinaimg.cn/upload/2015/09/25/3/timeline_card_small_web_default.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="surl-text"&gt;网页链接&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://weibo.com/n/%E9%9B%B6%E9%87%8D%E5%8A%9B%E7%93%A6%E5%8A%9B"&gt;@零重力瓦力&lt;/a&gt; Clawdbot堪比真人AI员工，深夜干活早发定制晨报&lt;a href="https://weibo.com/2192828333/5259406581171799" data-hide=""&gt;&lt;span class="url-icon"&gt;&lt;img style="width: 1rem;height: 1rem" src="https://h5.sinaimg.cn/upload/2015/09/25/3/timeline_card_small_web_default.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="surl-text"&gt;网页链接&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;【Clawdbot怎么用】&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://weibo.com/n/%E6%AD%B8%E8%97%8F%E7%9A%84AI%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E7%AE%B1"&gt;@歸藏的AI工具箱&lt;/a&gt; AWS免费套餐部署Clawdbot教程，2分钟快速上手&lt;a href="https://weibo.com/6182606334/5259090571299963" data-hide=""&gt;&lt;span class="url-icon"&gt;&lt;img style="width: 1rem;height: 1rem" src="https://h5.sinaimg.cn/upload/2015/09/25/3/timeline_card_small_web_default.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="surl-text"&gt;网页链接&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://weibo.com/n/GitHubDaily"&gt;@GitHubDaily&lt;/a&gt; GitHub爆火Clawdbot，本地运行的全能AI私人助手&lt